listed conditionally and needed no edit: no existing assertion stated that a
signature line followed by the header is `Unsupported`. `AmendmentAuditTests.cs`
is not edited.

## [ASSUMED] decisions (Class B, open to one-pass override)

- The generated Box 12 value is three leading zeros followed by six random
  digits, so it reads as synthetic. No rule depends on its shape and no CRA
  property is claimed for it.
- `Start-LocalDemo.ps1` calls the generator on every run; the generator keeps
  samples that already exist (`-Force` replaces them).
- The startup tool names the sample location as the repository-relative
  ignored directory, never an absolute path.

## Not observed

The bridge was not exercised by hand against a running local host: the host
running during this task was started from the pre-T02 build. The real upload
route is covered by the in-process HTTP suite above. The human-run demo is
T04's Definition of Done.

